2.9 Poultry House Design
The poultry house was designed to provide adequate space, ventilation, lighting, drainage, and protection from predators.
House Specifications
Item	Specification
Length	6 metres
Width	3 metres
Height	2.5 metres
Floor	Raised timber floor
Roofing	Corrugated iron sheets
Walls	Timber and wire mesh
Orientation	East-West

Climate-Smart Features
The poultry house incorporated:
•	Good natural ventilation.
•	East-West orientation.
•	Wide roof overhangs.
•	Rainwater harvesting gutters.
•	Footbath at the entrance.
•	Raised floor to reduce dampness.
•	Proper drainage.
•	Natural lighting.
•	Easy waste collection.
These features minimized heat stress, cold stress, disease incidence, and water wastage.
